256 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 233 0 R
/T (This past month, one of our clinicians, Vinay Verma,  Prosthetist and Orthotist,  attended SFL 7 a workshop in Texas where he had a chance to connect with amazing people, from quad amputees sharing their stories to fellow clinicians and specialists from around the world promoting and teaching important skills for mobility for amputees. These workshops were full of practical insights, from adaptive techniques to understanding the psychosocial side of limb loss. Helping people push boundaries to find new ways of living independently, this lessened fear and increased their confidence in taking risks with their mobility. The experience was a reminder of how crucial it is to take a patient-centered approach in everything we do.)
/E (This past month, one of our clinicians, Vinay Verma,  Prosthetist and Orthotist,  attended SFL 7 a workshop in Texas where he had a chance to connect with amazing people, from quad amputees sharing their stories to fellow clinicians and specialists from around the world promoting and teaching important skills for mobility for amputees. These workshops were full of practical insights, from adaptive techniques to understanding the psychosocial side of limb loss. Helping people push boundaries to find new ways of living independently, this lessened fear and increased their confidence in taking risks with their mobility. The experience was a reminder of how crucial it is to take a patient-centered approach in everything we do.)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
