/T (I would like to nominate Merry Majchrowski, Joliet, for employee of the month. She is an absolutely wonderful person and admin. Merry has stepped in to help out with other offices so many times while she has worked here and consistently goes above and beyond her roles as an admin. She is generous, efficient, and thorough in her work. I have only met her in person once, but she has helped me out so often that I want to nominate her and make sure she is recognized for her hard work!)
